{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56261","headline":"书壁（题拟） · 掌聿修","name":"书壁（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酒客乾喉去，唯存呷大夫。\n（见《说郛》卷六一《清异录》。\n）（〖1〗《清异录》：「家述、掌聿修仕僞蜀爲太子左赞善大夫。\n两人皆滑稽。\n聿修伺述酒翁将竭，叩门求饮，未通大道，已见罍耻，濡笔书壁曰〖诗略〗。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"掌聿修","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}